# Stripe Payment Link for the freelancer subscription (€20/month).
# Create it in the Stripe dashboard (Payment Links → Subscription) and paste the URL.
# Test mode links look like https://buy.stripe.com/test_…
# Inlined at build time (PUBLIC_*), so it must be set when `astro build` runs.
# When unset, the onboarding falls back to the demo "finish" flow without payment.
PUBLIC_STRIPE_PAYMENT_LINK=

# Platform endpoint that saves the onboarding settings as a draft before payment
# (BEX-2234), e.g. https://<platform-api-host>/onboardingDraft. Its draft id goes to
# Stripe as client_reference_id; after payment the platform builds the Default Offer
# from it. In the Payment Link set "After payment" → redirect to
#   https://<platform-host>/register-freelancer?checkout_session_id={CHECKOUT_SESSION_ID}
# The landing's origin must be allowed by the API (bench.exchange hosts, or
# ONBOARDING_DRAFT_ALLOWED_ORIGINS). When unset, payment works without carrying settings over.
PUBLIC_ONBOARDING_DRAFT_URL=
